#: ../../authentication.md:1
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "Ìmúdájú"

#: ../../authentication.md:3
msgid ""
"Every endpoint except `/health` needs an API key. Send it in the "
"`Authorization` header as a bearer token."
msgstr ""
"Gbogbo endpoint yàtọ̀ sí `/health` nílò API key. Rán an sí header "
"`Authorization` gẹ́gẹ́ bí Bearer token."

#: ../../authentication.md:9
msgid ""
"The public demo key is `lugha_demo_key`. It is shared and rate limited, "
"so use it for trying things out and nothing else."
msgstr ""
"Demo key gbogbogbòò ni `lugha_demo_key`. A ń pín in, ó sì ní ààlà lórí "
"iye ìlò, nítorí náà lo ó fún ìdánwò nìkan, kì í ṣe fún ohun mìíràn."

#: ../../authentication.md:11
msgid "Keep your key out of your code"
msgstr "Má fi key rẹ sínú code rẹ"

#: ../../authentication.md:13
msgid "Read the key from an environment variable."
msgstr "Ka key náà láti environment variable."

#: ../../authentication.md:21
msgid "Three rules keep keys safe."
msgstr "Àwọn òfin mẹ́ta ló ń ràn wá lọ́wọ́ láti dáàbò bo àwọn key."

#: ../../authentication.md:23
msgid ""
"Never commit a key to source control. Add any file that holds a key, such"
" as `.env`, to `.gitignore`."
msgstr ""
"Má ṣe commit key sínú source control láé. Fi fáìlì èyíkéyìí tó bá ní key, "
"gẹ́gẹ́ bí `.env`, sí `.gitignore`."

#: ../../authentication.md:24
msgid ""
"Never put a key in code that runs in a browser or a mobile app. Anyone "
"can read it. Call the API from your own server instead."
msgstr ""
"Má ṣe fi key sínú code tí ń ṣiṣẹ́ nínú browser tàbí mobile app láé. Ẹnikẹ́ni "
"ló lè kà á. Kàkà bẹ́ẹ̀, pe API náà láti inú server tirẹ."

#: ../../authentication.md:25
msgid ""
"Never paste a key into a support message. Send the `request_id` from the "
"error instead."
msgstr ""
"Má ṣe lẹ̀ key mọ́lẹ̀ sínú message support láé. Dípò bẹ́ẹ̀, fi "
"`request_id` tí ó wà nínú error ránṣẹ́."

#: ../../authentication.md:27
msgid "Rotate keys without downtime"
msgstr "Yí àwọn key padà láì dá iṣẹ́ dúró"

#: ../../authentication.md:29
msgid "The service accepts more than one key at a time. To rotate:"
msgstr "Service náà ń gba key tó ju ọ̀kan lọ ní àkókò kan. Láti yí wọn padà:"

#: ../../authentication.md:31
msgid "Add the new key alongside the old one."
msgstr "Fi key tuntun kún un lẹ́gbẹ̀ẹ́ key àtijọ́ náà."

#: ../../authentication.md:32
msgid "Deploy your applications with the new key."
msgstr "Deploy àwọn application rẹ pẹ̀lú key tuntun náà."

#: ../../authentication.md:33
msgid "Remove the old key once nothing uses it."
msgstr "Yọ key àtijọ́ náà kúrò nígbà tí kò sí ohun tó ń lò ó mọ́."

#: ../../authentication.md:35
msgid "If a key leaks, remove it straight away and issue a new one."
msgstr ""
"Tí key kan bá jáde síta, yọ ọ́ kúrò lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀ kí o sì ṣe key tuntun."

#: ../../authentication.md:37
msgid "Authentication errors"
msgstr "Àwọn aṣìṣe ìmúdájú"

#: ../../authentication.md:39
msgid "Both authentication failures return status `401`."
msgstr "Àwọn ìkùnà ìmúdájú méjèèjì máa ń dá status `401` padà."

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "`type`"
msgstr "`type`"

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "Cause"
msgstr "Ìdí"

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "What to do"
msgstr "Ohun tí o yẹ kí o ṣe"

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "`authentication_required`"
msgstr "`authentication_required`"

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "The `Authorization` header is missing, or it does not start with `Bearer`."
msgstr ""
"Header `Authorization` kò sí, tàbí kò bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú `Bearer`."

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "Add the header in the format above."
msgstr "Fi header náà kún un ní irú ọ̀nà tí a fi hàn lókè."

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "`invalid_api_key`"
msgstr "`invalid_api_key`"

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "The header is well formed but the key is not recognised."
msgstr "Header náà wà ní ọ̀nà tó tọ́, ṣùgbọ́n a kò mọ key náà."

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "Check for typos, extra spaces and expired keys."
msgstr ""
"Ṣàyẹ̀wò àwọn àṣìṣe ìkọ̀wé, àwọn space tó pọ̀ ju, àti àwọn key tó ti parí."

#: ../../authentication.md:46
msgid "Do not retry a `401`. The same request will fail the same way."
msgstr ""
"Má ṣe tún `401` gbìyànjú. Request kan náà yóò tún kùnà ní ọ̀nà kan náà."